  "description": "PROPOSED OUTBUILDING",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Due to the  failure to submit an Arboricultural Impact Assessment, Arboricultural Method Statement, Trees Constraints Plan and Tree Protection Plan  Officers are unable to fully assess the impact of the proposed development on the existing trees within the application site and on  neighbouring trees which are considered to contribute positively to the character of the area.  The applicant has therefore failed to demonstrate, through the submission of cogent information, that the proposed development would not have an unacceptable adverse impact  on existing  trees and that the proposals would preserve the character and appearance  of  Kingston Hill/Coombe Hill Strategic Area of Special Character contrary to Policies DM10 and DM12 of the Kingston Core Strategy (2012) and Policy G7 of the London Plan (2021).\r"
